1
00:00:03,250 --> 00:00:04,958
慢点，里面烫
Careful, it's hot inside

2
00:00:04,958 --> 00:00:07,333
谢了，袋子不用
Thanks, no bag needed

3
00:00:10,542 --> 00:00:11,958
垫着吧
Here, use this

4
