Someone tossed theirs on the floor last time

5
00:00:16,417 --> 00:00:17,667
这个也算上
Add this too

6
00:00:33,792 --> 00:00:35,792
还没扫上
It hasn't scanned yet

7
00:00:40,542 --> 00:00:41,875
师傅
Excuse me

8
00:00:43,625 --> 00:00:45,333
你找老板
Looking for the owner

9
00:00:45,333 --> 00:00:46,167
后边呢
In the back

10
00:00:47,333 --> 00:00:48,000
不是
No

11
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,333
刚才这个小伙子
The young guy who was just here

12
00:00:51,375 --> 00:00:53,333
什么小伙子
What young guy

13
00:00:54,167 --> 00:00:55,792
